      "source": "Represents a function that accepts a SQL string and a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ParametersSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ParametersSource</code></a> as arguments and produces a result.\nIdeal to run statements using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a> .",
      "translation": "表示一个函数，它接受 SQL 字符串和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ParametersSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ParametersSource</code></a> 作为参数，并产生结果。\n非常适合使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a> 运行语句。",
